sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Operator
    participant UI
    participant Manager as Round 5 manager
    participant LB as Lakebase pipeline
    participant LBR as Lakebase runner
    participant AWS as AWS pipeline
    participant RDS as AWS RDS control plane
    participant AWSR as Competitor runner

    Note over Manager,AWSR: A READY warm generation already owns two fresh runner receipts and both target receipts
    Note over RDS: No per-bout RDS Proxy exists before the bell

    Operator->>UI: Ring bell
    UI->>Manager: POST /run (claim_id, idempotency key)
    Manager->>Manager: Durable CLAIMED to RUNNING CAS
    Manager->>Manager: Capture only comparison T0
    par Same event-loop turn
        Manager-)LB: Release Lakebase gate
        LB->>LBR: run_lane_v3(job_id)
    and
        Manager-)AWS: Release AWS gate
        AWS->>RDS: CreateDBProxy
    and
        Manager-->>UI: RUNNING + two active elapsed floors
    end

    LBR->>LBR: Client 1 verifies pooled path and remains held
    LBR-->>Manager: Ramp progress
    LBR-->>Manager: Exactly 10,000 held
    Manager-->>UI: Stop Lakebase observed bell clock

    RDS-->>AWS: Proxy available + target available
    AWS->>AWS: Verify exact role, auth, TLS, VPC, subnet and SG bindings
    AWS->>AWSR: run_lane_v3(job_id)
    AWSR->>AWSR: Client 1 verifies Proxy path and remains held
    AWSR-->>Manager: Ramp progress
    AWSR-->>Manager: Exactly 10,000 held
    Manager-->>UI: Stop competitor observed bell clock

    Manager->>Manager: Validate hold, samples, telemetry and identity
    Manager-->>UI: Verified result or explicit failure
    Manager->>RDS: Deregister target, delete Proxy, prove absence
    Manager->>Manager: Enqueue next warm generation automatically
